  "question": {
    "text": "Let the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>. Then the value of the integral&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
